(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF ELECTRONICS AND INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: GENESIS \(GEN-NEXT SUPPORT FOR INNOVATIVE STARTUPS\) \(GENESIS\) / MEITY / MEITY STARTUP HUB) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Rs. 490 Crore umbrella initiative to discover, support, and scale tech) Tj
T*
(startups from Tier-II and Tier-III cities across India with discovery) Tj
T*
(grants and pilot linkages.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. DPIIT-recognized tech startups registered and operating out of Tier-II) Tj
T*
(   and Tier-III cities.) Tj
T*
(2. Tech-driven product or intellectual property.) Tj
T*
(3. Indian promoter ownership > 51%.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Financial grants up to Rs. 25 Lakh for pilot rollouts, cloud infrastructure) Tj
T*
(   credits, and direct market access partnerships.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 25.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. DPIIT Recognition Certificate) Tj
T*
(2. Registered address proof confirming Tier-II/III operational location) Tj
T*
(3. Product demo and customer deployment metrics) Tj
T*
(4. ROC Incorporation Certificate) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via MeitY Startup Hub Portal) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://msh.meity.gov.in/schemes/genesis) Tj
T*
ET
